    <string name="settings_dsh_import_info_msg">Select a DSH layer package (.tar.zst / .tar.gz / .tar, or a .zip containing one — a single top-level directory prefix is allowed).\n\nIt must contain: node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh (entry lib/bin.js + dependencies) and package.json. The package is unpacked to a staging area and validated first; non-DSH files are rejected and the existing DSH stays untouched.\n\nImport replaces runtime-current/dsh (the old layer is backed up to previous/dsh for rollback); the base/node/android-side runtime and user-data/.dsh are not affected.</string>
